/-!
# Stage P4.3 (`remove_pre_key`) on 1-Element `previous_sessions`

Proves Substage P4.3 (`remove_pre_key`) over a 1-element `previous_sessions` vector `prevVecAt [enc]`,
advancing to `+0x3cc` on `Ok(())` and unwinding to `s0.readReg64 .x30` on `Err(e)`.
-/

public section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 200000
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false

